Codegen source fixtures
=======================

Raw .expected files contain unchanged tinygrad
d0c9745274335e44b5dd7c15b8422c2b684a3ed9 output. Adjacent .expected.diff
files cover the reviewed IEEE differences in DIVERGENCES.md: float grouping,
leading reduction +0, and MAX NaN propagation and second-operand ties.
Dune compares the exact upstream-to-Tolk diff, including hashes of both
complete outputs. Reference generation excludes these diff artifacts; no
source normalization is used. See ../README.md for the review workflow.
